{"4959650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "P.R.O.E.B.", "steam_appid": 4959650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/b385b85d5cc5539f58f87b0254e7b2a4.avif?t=1785861613\" width=1085 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.R.O.E.B. (Procedural Resource Operation &amp; Efficiency Bureau) is a co-op horror game where you experience life as an ordinary factory worker trapped inside a Soviet dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet impossible production quotas, sabotage the factory from within, and search for a way out using physics-based interactions with machines, tools, and the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/e408e2e129fce6b800989a673a9e86f4.webp?t=1785861613\" width=993 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK HARD...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your production quotas across dozens of industrial facilities while carefully managing your fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself too far, and the Bureau will make sure you're disciplined accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/8811aff5b27c0d571692f6cb0e6eb4f2.poster.avif?t=1785861613\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/8811aff5b27c0d571692f6cb0e6eb4f2.webm?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/8811aff5b27c0d571692f6cb0e6eb4f2.mp4?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...OR DESTROY THE FACTORY...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes causing an industrial disaster is easier than finishing your shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger accidents, distract supervisors, and use the chaos to explore restricted areas unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/46bc8fa108eba4a23b38c912fd807943.poster.avif?t=1785861613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/46bc8fa108eba4a23b38c912fd807943.webm?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/46bc8fa108eba4a23b38c912fd807943.mp4?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...TO FIND A WAY OUT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the factory for exit keycards before your shift ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture into the complex, the more dangerous every step becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/fb7d0dbe7d7c85985344e95a8902fb67.poster.avif?t=1785861613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/fb7d0dbe7d7c85985344e95a8902fb67.webm?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/fb7d0dbe7d7c85985344e95a8902fb67.mp4?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/e408e2e129fce6b800989a673a9e86f4.webp?t=1785861613\" width=993 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH ISN'T THE END</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death doesn't mean you're finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your teammates survive... or become the worst thing still haunting the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/5c6e431c4128dc3cd0ed851f967b6eea.poster.avif?t=1785861613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/5c6e431c4128dc3cd0ed851f967b6eea.webm?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/5c6e431c4128dc3cd0ed851f967b6eea.mp4?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/e408e2e129fce6b800989a673a9e86f4.webp?t=1785861613\" width=993 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new outfits and customize your worker with a growing collection of clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because even in a dystopian factory, style matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/a40c0e5519e464646c5be97251e10371.poster.avif?t=1785861613\" width=864 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/a40c0e5519e464646c5be97251e10371.webm