othing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because even in a dystopian factory, style matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/a40c0e5519e464646c5be97251e10371.poster.avif?t=1785861613\" width=864 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/a40c0e5519e464646c5be97251e10371.webm?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/extras/a40c0e5519e464646c5be97251e10371.mp4?t=1785861613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial sabotage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost gameplay after death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worker customization</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Work, sabotage, and escape together. Complete your production quotas across dozens of Soviet factories, outsmart relentless robot supervisors, and find your way to freedom before the ruthless authoritarian machine grinds you to dust!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/c5306a8e59d967c0ae9895041faeb01761778ede/header.jpg?t=1785861613", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959650/c18c78c9507b378865ba358d2ff10e9c606e1e53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785861613", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/49